      "created_at": "2014-03-06T18:12:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think of it as 23 Heroes (with 18 promos), 18 Villains (with 4 Promos) plus the Vengeful Five, and 14 Environments myself, since I don't think a statistic which conflates decks with promo versions is terribly useful, but yeah.</p><p>You know what the Dark Watch's true purpose is? &nbsp;It's not about safeguarding the world from the Rotting God, it's about providing promos to non-Core Set heroes. &nbsp;Because they are the only ones.</p>",
