      "raw": "[quote=\"Ironic\"]\n\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Matchstickman wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Unity cries, forgotten in the corner.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nUnity is an honorary Core Set hero, given her release time.\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;m guessing because she was released at the same time as Enhanced Edition? Which was also released with Infernal Relics. Meaning Infernal Relics are also honorary core heroes. Infernal Relics is now packaged with Rook City. Does that mean Rook City heroes are also honorary core heroes? This is getting confusing.\n<blockquote>\nAlso, I am pretty sure that nobody ever uses Golem Unity.\n</blockquote>\nI am pretty sure that is completely false.\n\n&nbsp;\n",
