      "created_at": "2014-03-06T19:12:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"UXM266\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/48/1966_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> UXM266:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br><blockquote>[...]<br><blockquote>Also, I am pretty sure that nobody ever uses Golem Unity.&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nI am pretty sure that is completely false.&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nPeople use her as a challenge, but it's not super fun to play. Even on the boards, there isn't much praise from her.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I find Golem Unity super fun to play.</p>\n<p>\"Haha! I play Supply Crate to draw a card, start of my next turn I can destroy it to draw 2 more cards! I then deal myself 4 damage for Golem Spawn and get Platform Bot, which will blast something for 3 points of damage. Mwahahaha!!! Feel my Golem Spawning wrath!!!\"</p>\n<p>\"Hmm… I play Supply Crate and draw a card. Now I can either Bot Hack it to get Platform Bot out&nbsp;or I could destroy at the start of my next turn to draw 2 more cards…\"</p>",
